     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">Here is some example code that did not work for me - Every time I closed a browser window and opened a new one , I would see the &#39;Expensive&#39; operation being performed on Shinyapps.io . </span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\"><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">How do I make sure that some expensive operation is called ONLY once at the time the application is started up the first time and the expensive object is shared across ALL user sessions ? Kind of a Global Cache object that is never removed until the Application is shutdown or  the object explicitly removed from the Global cache?</span><br><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">#ui.R</span></div><div><div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">shinyUI(pageWithSidebar(</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">  headerPanel(&quot;Shiny Scoping Rules Test&quot;),</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">  sidebarPanel(</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">    sliderInput(&quot;obs&quot;, &quot;Number of observations:&quot;,</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">                min = 0, max = 1000, value = 500)</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">  ),</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">  mainPanel(</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">    plotOutput(&quot;myplot&quot;)</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">  )</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">))</span></font></div></div><div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:21px\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">#server.R</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><div style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">source(&quot;bigDataFrame.R&quot;,local = TRUE)  </div><div style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:21px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:21px\"># Calling the Expensive Operation outside the shinyServer() call</div><div style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">data &lt;- buildBigDataFrame( )</div><div style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:21px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">shinyServer(function(input, output) {</div><div style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:21px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">  # A histogram</div><div style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">  output$myplot &lt;- renderPlot({</div><div style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">    hist(data[c(1:input$obs),1], main=&quot;Histogram&quot;)</div><div style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">  })</div><div style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">})</div><div style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:21px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:21px\"># bigDataFrame.R<br></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:21px\"># Some really expensive operation that will read a file and generate a </span><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">data frame with a Million rows</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:21px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">buildBigDataFrame  &lt;- function(){</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">  print(&quot;Running a really expensive Operation!&quot;)</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">  bigDataFrame &lt;- data.frame(x=c(1:1000000),y=c(2:1000001),z=c(3,1000002))</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">  return(bigDataFrame)</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">  </span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">}</span></div></div><div><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:21px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">Appreciate any insights into how to make the Application share the &#39;</span><b style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">data&#39;</b><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:21px\"> object across all User Sessions.</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-hei